{"id":"b1-u05","level":"b1","order":5,"title":{"en":"Colours and things","fr":"Couleurs et objets","es":"Colores y objetos","ar":"الألوان والأشياء"},"tip":{"en":"Ask 'What is this?' and answer 'This is a book.' Colour words describe the thing: the book is red.","fr":"Demandez « Qu'est-ce que c'est ? » et répondez « C'est un livre. » Les couleurs décrivent l'objet : le livre est rouge.","es":"Pregunta «¿Qué es esto?» y responde «Esto es un libro». Los colores describen la cosa: el libro es rojo.","ar":"اسأل «ما هذا؟» وأجب «هذا كتاب». كلمات الألوان تصف الشيء: الكتاب أحمر."},"words":12,"lessons":[{"id":"b1-u05-l1","type":"learn","order":1,"title":{"en":"red, blue, green","fr":"rouge, bleu, vert","es":"rojo, azul, verde","ar":"أحمر، أزرق، أخضر"},"count":10},{"id":"b1-u05-l2","type":"learn","order":2,"title":{"en":"black, white, book","fr":"noir, blanc, livre","es":"negro, blanco, libro","ar":"أسود، أبيض، كتاب"},"count":9},{"id":"b1-u05-l3","type":"learn","order":3,"title":{"en":"table, door, what is this","fr":"table, porte, qu'est-ce que c'est","es":"mesa, puerta, qué es esto","ar":"طاولة، باب، ما هذا"},"count":10},{"id":"b1-u05-l4","type":"story","order":4,"title":{"en":"Conversation","fr":"Conversation","es":"Conversación","ar":"محادثة"},"count":10},{"id":"b1-u05-l5","type":"review","order":5,"title":{"en":"Unit review","fr":"Révision de l'unité","es":"Repaso de la unidad","ar":"مراجعة الوحدة"},"count":10}]}
